Contains information from OpenWeather, https://openweathermap.org/,
which is made available under the Open Database License (ODbL).

Changes: weather observations were aggregated by grazing-event interval into
mean/minimum/maximum temperature, mean humidity and total precipitation,
with availability indicators, and combined with pasture and herd records.
Four operational identifiers were replaced with stable pseudonyms.

